{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"はっぴーバレンタイン♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/14/0529315/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前は\nCD特典イベント\n似顔絵会、録音会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれたみなさんありがとう☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似顔絵会の方は\nまあまあ上手に描けたよ～⊂( ˆoˆ )⊃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似てた......かな？どうかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも頑張って\n気持ちを込めて一枚一枚描いたので\n大切にしてね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"録音会は新しいスタイルで\nみんなに聞かれながら話すっていう\n恥ずかしいやーつでした///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもみんなの聞くの\n楽しかったからいっか(´｡･v･｡｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"録音した方はいっぱい聞いてね♡\n声に残るのって近い感じがして\nなんかいいよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/14/0529315/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/14/0529315/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーあすかりん楽しそうだぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜日は京都で\nアルバムスペシャル握手会があります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行くよーってみなさんは\nよろしくね！\n楽しみにしてます( ˇωˇ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは1部から3部です\n何着ようかな～＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さらに、明日はのぎ天生放送！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Viberという通話アプリから\n私たちにメッセージが送れちゃいますよ\nたくさんのおたより待ってます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳しいことはのぎ天本編で\nきいちゃんとまあやとお話してるので\nぜひチェックしてみてね（ ˆoˆ ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/14/0529315/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"触角なしやで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろ見慣れたかな？\nいろんな人が褒めてくれる（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/14/0529315/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/14/0529315/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのオススメの\n勉強法とかある？\nベタだけど赤シートにオレンジペン。\nあと眠くてどうしようもないときは\n無理矢理やっても頭入んないし\n効率も悪いので寝る！\n寝てる間にしっかり記憶してくれるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/14/0529315/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんって真面目ですか？\n学校とかで掃除ちゃんとしたり\n提出物だしたりしてた？笑\n真面目だよ(゜ω゜)♡\n真面目そうに見えるかはわかんないけど\n超絶真面目♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/14/0529315/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんってししゃも\nどっから食べる？\n頭！賢くな～れ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/14/0529315/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子の好きな髪型ってなぁに???\nツインは言うまでもないけど\nそれ以外だと編み込み下ろし巻きとか。\n編み込みしてるおにゃのこって\nお人形さんみたいって思う♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/14/0529315/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは バレンタインに\nメンバーとかにチョコあげるんですか？\n毎年何かしらあげるよ！\n別にイベント好きとかではないけど\nバレンタインはきっちりしたいなって。\n今年はお菓子じゃなくて\nお菓子モチーフの\n雑貨にしました( ˇωˇ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/14/0529315/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの日記の\nコメント欄下２ケタに46を踏んだ方へ\n手書きでコメ返するコーナー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ ひめたん46 ／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/14/0529315/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/14/0529315/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/14/0529315/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもたくさんのコメント\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は久々の京都\\(  ˆoˆ  )/\nライブももうちょっとなので\n頑張ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもより短いけど終わり☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)"}],"source":"archive"}